# ================================================================
# GeoRepo Geological Field-to-Report Automation System
# Environment & API Key Configuration Template
# ================================================================
# Note: GeoRepo runs 100% OFFLINE without any API keys using its
# built-in geological domain rule parser and Web Speech Recognition.
#
# If you want cloud AI models, you can use these FREE alternatives:
# ================================================================

# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 1: GROQ (100% FREE - RECOMMENDED)
# Fast cloud Whisper & LLaMA 3.3. No credit card required.
# Get free key at: https://console.groq.com/keys
# - Provides: whisper-large-v3 (Speech-to-Text)
# - Provides: llama-3.3-70b-versatile (Entity Extraction)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here

# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 2: GOOGLE GEMINI (100% FREE)
# Free Gemini 2.0 Flash via Google AI Studio. No credit card.
# Get free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# - Provides: gemini-2.0-flash (Structured Entity Extraction)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 3: OPENROUTER (FREE TIER AVAILABLE)
# Access free models with ':free' tag (e.g. meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free)
# Get free key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your_openrouter_api_key_here

# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 4: OPENAI (PAID SUBSCRIPTION - OPTIONAL)
# Only if you have a paid OpenAI account with active credits.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key_here

# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Option 5: NVIDIA NIM (OPTIONAL)
# Get key at: https://build.nvidia.com/
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_NVIDIA_API_KEY=your_nvidia_api_key_here
